pr — Multi-License
==================

This project uses different licenses for different components.

Component License Map
---------------------

  src/proot/                    GPL-2.0-or-later  (derivative of proot/termux-proot)
  src/pr-cli/                   GPL-3.0-or-later  (derivative of termux-proot-distro)
  src/proot-integration-test/   MIT
  android/                      MIT
  scripts/                      MIT
  docs/                         MIT

Vendor submodules (READ ONLY, not modified):
  vendor/proot/                 GPL-2.0
  vendor/termux-proot/          GPL-2.0
  vendor/termux-proot-distro/   GPL-3.0
  vendor/busybox/               GPL-2.0
  vendor/samba/                 GPL-3.0 (talloc, the only part used: LGPL-3.0-or-later)
  vendor/musl/                  MIT
  vendor/bionic/                BSD (AOSP)
  vendor/termlib/               Apache-2.0

Full license texts are in the vendor subdirectories.

Prebuilt binaries in android/proot-engine/src/main/jniLibs/
--------------------------------------------------------------

  libproot.so                       built from src/proot/ with talloc from
                                    vendor/samba; GPL-2.0-or-later, and
                                    GPL-3.0 as a whole because talloc is
                                    LGPL-3.0-or-later
  libproot-loader.so                built from src/proot/src/loader/;
                                    GPL-2.0-or-later
  libpr-cli.so                      built from src/pr-cli/; GPL-3.0-or-later
  libbusybox.so                     Alpine Linux busybox-static 1.37.0-r14
                                    (scripts/download-busybox.sh);
                                    GPL-2.0-only

The Android code runs these as separate programs, so it keeps its own
license.

GPL-2.0-or-later
-----------------

This license applies to src/proot/ (derivative work of proot v5.4.0 by
STMicroelectronics / Cédric Vincent, and termux-proot by Termux contributors).

Full text: vendor/proot/COPYING

GPL-3.0-or-later
-----------------

This license applies to src/pr-cli/, a Rust port of termux-proot-distro by
Termux contributors, including the plug-in files copied from it under
src/pr-cli/tests/fixtures/plugins/.

Full text: vendor/termux-proot-distro/LICENSE

